                        TERMS AND CONDITIONS

1. Definitions

   "Software" means the Agent Package (.apm) format specification,
   apm-kit command-line tools, runtime contract definitions, and all
   source code, documentation, and configuration files distributed in
   this repository.

   "Package" means any .agent source directory or .apm sealed artifact
   created using the Software.

   "Managed Service" means making the Software available to third parties
   as a commercially offered online service that executes Packages on
   behalf of those third parties. For clarity, the following are NOT
   Managed Services:
     (a) using the Software to execute Packages for your own internal
         business purposes, even on cloud infrastructure;
     (b) using the Software to execute Packages on a user's own device
         or infrastructure under that user's direct control;
     (c) distributing the Software as part of a development tool,
         editor plugin, or local runner that executes Packages on the
         end user's own machine;
     (d) embedding Package execution in a product where the primary
         value is not the execution service itself (e.g., an application
         that internally uses Packages to automate its own workflows).

